Quick start

  Normal include mode:

    #include "@PID0_SINGLE_HEADER_FILENAME@"

  Implementation mode:

    #define PID0_IMPLEMENTATION
    #include "@PID0_SINGLE_HEADER_FILENAME@"

  Define PID0_IMPLEMENTATION in exactly one C translation unit in your program.
  Other translation units should include the header without defining
  PID0_IMPLEMENTATION.

Configuration notes

  - This single-header distribution targets the same Linux/POSIX process APIs
    as the normal library build.
  - The generated header contains the public API first and the implementation
    under the PID0_IMPLEMENTATION section.
